  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen Laikipia Conservancies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to strengthen Laikipia Conservancies as resource management institutions. The project also focuses on building the capacity of the umbrella organization, LCA, which is a locally owned organization in this important landscape. By building collaboration among conservancies and with other stakeholders, natural resource management will improve and help alleviate natural resources as a driver of conflict in northern Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
